      "id": "",
      "text": "What fits on each side?",
      "y": 2101
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Presence becomes part of the contract.",
      "y": 2270
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Output: the same four-field slice at capture and spool boundaries.",
      "y": 3613
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Resources: replace a local factory’s record with the shared resource section.",
      "y": 4152
    },
    {
      "tag": "H4",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Lifecycle: group fields by owner, with one deliberately small input.",
      "y": 4573
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The type references move. The modules stay.",
      "y": 5004
    },
    {
